<title>USA: Wall Street stocks higher at start.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks higher at start.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks moved higher in early trading, boosted by a steady bond market and a rally in high tech shares after Microsoft reported better than forecast earnings.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial average was up 12 points at 6671.</p>
</text>
